  "<strong>No time slot needed.</strong> First boat 10:00 (10:30 on winter weekdays), last 21:40 to 23:00 depending on season and day. Until 18 December: Monday to Thursday 10:30 to 21:40, Friday to 22:00, weekends from 10:00. In July and August boats leave every 30 minutes, every 20 minutes in the evening, until 23:00. Show up any time on your chosen day and board the next boat. Boats every 30 minutes in summer, every 45 to 60 minutes in winter.<span class=\"bpa-lang-note\">Running late or the plan changes? Your ticket still works later that day.</span><span class=\"bpa-lang-note bpa-sparkle\">✨ After dark, the Eiffel Tower sparkles for 5 minutes at the start of every hour. Be on the water around the hour to see it.</span>": {
   "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
   "where": "card-1 pills[0].pop_html"
  },
  "<strong>Port de la Bourdonnais, next to the Eiffel Tower.</strong> Go to Zone 3.1 for the bag check, then wait in the covered area with vending machines.": {
